        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden object game where you must find all the stars to complete the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ 1 Large Vector Artwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ 600 Hidden Stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 1 Achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 No Hints or Support for extra challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Zoom In/Out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Relaxing music and Ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌨️ Use only your Mouse or Mouse + Keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💾 Autosave. Pick up from where you left off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗑️ Reset progress and play again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My friend -the Dream Dragon- lost my collection of 600 stars. Can you help me find them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Left Mouse Button + Mouse Movement: Pan and Movement in the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Left Mouse Button  to  Collect Stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Wheel for Zooming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD / Keyboard Arrows: Movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC in-game to access the Pause Menu.</p></li></ul>",
